8	//! definition and an order-sensitive stack fold); the two implementations
9	//! agree for every vector, and the one-leaf/empty cases were additionally
10	//! cross-checked against the system `sha256sum`. The constants below are
11	//! copied from that generator and never derived from roottrace output.
